e": "Zheng", "firstName": "Shuangjia", "initials": "S", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-9747-4285"}}, {"fullName": "Li L", "lastName": "Li", "firstName": "Liang", "initials": "L"}, {"fullName": "Zhang X", "lastName": "Zhang", "firstName": "Xiang", "initials": "X"}, {"fullName": "Zhang X", "lastName": "Zhang", "firstName": "Xiaodong", "initials": "X"}, {"fullName": "Huang Z", "lastName": "Huang", "firstName": "Ziwang", "initials": "Z"}, {"fullName": "Chen J", "lastName": "Chen", "firstName": "Jianwen", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7999-2070"}}, {"fullName": "Wang R", "lastName": "Wang", "firstName": "Ruixuan", "initials": "R", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-8714-0369"}}, {"fullName": "Zhao H", "lastName": "Zhao", "firstName": "Huiying", "initials": "H", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-9134-536X"}}, {"fullName": "Chong Y", "lastName": "Chong", "firstName": "Yutian", "initials": "Y"}, {"fullName": "Shen J", "lastName": "Shen", "firstName": "Jun", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7746-5285"}}, {"fullName": "Zha Y", "lastName": "Zha", "firstName": "Yunfei", "initials": "Y"}, {"fullName": "Yang Y", "lastName": "Yang", "firstName": "Yuedong", "initials": "Y", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6782-2813"}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7746-5285"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7999-2070"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-9134-536X"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-9747-4285"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6782-2813"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-8714-0369"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "6", "volume": "18", "journalIssueId": 3279564, "dateOfPublication": "2021 Nov-Dec", "monthOfPublication": 0, "yearOfPublication": 2021, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "IEEE/ACM Trans Comput Biol Bioinform", "title": "IEEE/ACM transactions on computational biology and bioinformatics", "essn": "1557-9964", "issn": "1545-5963", "nlmid": "101196755", "isoabbreviation": "IEEE/ACM Trans Comput Biol Bioinform"}, "printPublicationDate": "2021-11-01"}, "pubYear": "2021", "pageInfo": "2775-2780", "abstractText": "A novel coronavirus (COVID-19) recently emerged as an acute respiratory syndrome, and has caused a pneumonia outbreak world-widely. As the COVID-19 continues to spread rapidly across the world, computed tomography (CT) has become essentially important for fast diagnoses. Thus, it is urgent to develop an accurate computer-aided method to assist clinicians to identify COVID-19-infected patients by CT images. Here, we have collected chest CT scans of 88 patients diagnosed with COVID-19 from hospitals of two provinces in China, 100 patients infected with bacteria pneumonia, and 86 healthy persons for comparison and modeling. Based on the data, a deep learning-based CT diagnosis system was developed to identify patients with COVID-19. The experimental results showed that our model could accurately discriminate the COVID-19 patients from the bacteria pneumonia patients with an AUC of 0.95, recall (sensitivity) of 0.96, and precision of 0.79. When integrating three types of CT images, our model achieved a recall of 0.93 with precision of 0.86 for discriminating COVID-19 patients from others. Moreover, our model could extract main lesion features, especially the ground-glass opacity (GGO), which are visually helpful for assisted diagnoses by doctors. An online server is available for online diagnoses with CT images by our server (http://biomed.nscc-gz.cn/model.php). Source codes and datasets are available at our GitHub (https://github.com/SY575/COVID19-CT).", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["brief-report", "Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Introducing Innovative and Entrepreneurial Teams", "grantId": "2016ZT06D211", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Natural Science Foundation of Guangdong Province", "grantId": "2019A1515012207", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Natural Science Foundation of China", "grantId": "81801132", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Natural Science Foundation of China", "grantId": "U1611261", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Guangdong Frontier and Key Tech Innovation Program", "grantId": "2018B010109006", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Natural Science Foundation of China", "grantId": "61772566", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Natural Science Foundation of China", "grantId": "81871332", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Key Research and Development Program of China", "grantId": "2018YFC1315405", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Guangdong Frontier and Key Tech Innovation Program", "grantId": "2019B020228001", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Pneumonia, Bacterial", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "DI", "qualifierName": "diagnosis"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Diagnosis, Computer-Assisted", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "SN", "qualifierName": "statistics & numerical data"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Diagnosis, Differential"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Tomography, X-Ray Computed", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "SN", "qualifierName": "statistics & numerical data"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Models, Statistical"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Case-Control Studies"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Computational Biology"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "